# Defense in depth: never commit a wallet/seed note, API-key sheet or key file even if someone
# drops one under .claude/. Shared Spec Kit skills/templates are deliberately NOT matched.
.claude/near-wallet.txt
**/near-wallet*.txt
.claude/hackathon-apikeys.txt
**/hackathon-apikeys*.txt
.claude/**/*apikey*
.claude/**/*api-key*
.claude/**/*secret*
.claude/**/wallet*.txt
.claude/**/*.key
.claude/**/*.pem

